OL,3,GNEWSATown plagued by guerrilla parking,
OL,4,Acouncillor says                        
OL,6,FA councillor who condemned a "plague of
OL,7,Fguerrilla parking" in a Surrey town has
OL,8,Furged drivers to use official parking  
OL,9,Fspaces instead of loading bays.        
OL,11,FGeorge Hesse, who represents Castle    
OL,12,Fward at Waverley Borough Council and   
OL,13,FFarnham Town Council, said some bays   
OL,14,Fbrought in by improvement works in     
OL,15,FFarnham had yet to be marked with      
OL,16,Fyellow lines or signs to show parking  
OL,17,Frestrictions.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
