OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATown plagued by guerrilla parking,
OL,4,Acouncillor says                        
OL,6,FHe told the BBC "opportunists and      
OL,7,Fselfish parking by motorists" had      
OL,8,Ftreated ones in West Street and Castle 
OL,9,FStreet as free spaces when "they're    
OL,10,Fneeded by delivery drivers".           
OL,12,FSurrey County Council (SCC) said new   
OL,13,Fsignage and the painting of new street 
OL,14,Fmarkings was due to be completed next  
OL,15,Fweek.                                  
